From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Topazio Mobile Server OS <opensource@topazio.invalid>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 00:00:00 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] sea: keep Focaltech touch, disable embedded auto-upgrade

The public Xiaomi tree references the unavailable customer file
include/firmware/fw_sample.i from focaltech_flash.c. The driver has a separate
touch-data/input path, while fts_fwupg_work() returns before any update when
FTS_AUTO_UPGRADE_EN is zero. Do not disable CONFIG_TOUCHSCREEN_FTS and do not
invent firmware bytes. Keeping the request_firmware/manual update code intact
preserves a future device-specific update mechanism without committing a blob.

This patch belongs only to SERVER_MINIMAL and must never be applied to
VENDOR_REFERENCE.
---
 drivers/input/touchscreen/mediatek/ft3418_i2c/focaltech_config.h | 2 +-
 drivers/input/touchscreen/mediatek/ft3418_i2c/focaltech_flash.c  | 4 ++++
 2 files changed, 5 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/input/touchscreen/mediatek/ft3418_i2c/focaltech_config.h b/drivers/input/touchscreen/mediatek/ft3418_i2c/focaltech_config.h
--- a/drivers/input/touchscreen/mediatek/ft3418_i2c/focaltech_config.h
+++ b/drivers/input/touchscreen/mediatek/ft3418_i2c/focaltech_config.h
@@ -244,1 +244,1 @@
-#define FTS_AUTO_UPGRADE_EN                     1
+#define FTS_AUTO_UPGRADE_EN                     0
diff --git a/drivers/input/touchscreen/mediatek/ft3418_i2c/focaltech_flash.c b/drivers/input/touchscreen/mediatek/ft3418_i2c/focaltech_flash.c
--- a/drivers/input/touchscreen/mediatek/ft3418_i2c/focaltech_flash.c
+++ b/drivers/input/touchscreen/mediatek/ft3418_i2c/focaltech_flash.c
@@ -52,1 +52,2 @@
+#if FTS_AUTO_UPGRADE_EN
 u8 fw_file[] = {
@@ -68,1 +69,4 @@
 };
+#else
+struct upgrade_module module_list[] = { {FTS_MODULE_ID, FTS_MODULE_NAME, NULL, 0} };
+#endif
